            <h3>Charlotte Amtrak Station (Main Station)</h3>
            <p>The primary hub for all Charlotte-to-Miami rail service. This station serves the Piedmont, Carolinian, Crescent, and Silver Meteor services. It offers basic amenities and is easily accessible from Uptown Charlotte via short taxi or rideshare. The station is currently planned for relocation to a more central location in the future.</p>
            <h3>What This Means for Travelers</h3>
            <ul>
                <li>Downtown Charlotte departures offer the best flexibility and easiest access to the city.</li>
                <li>The current station location is just north of Uptown, so plan for a short taxi/rideshare if coming from downtown hotels.</li>
                <li>North Carolina Context: Charlotte serves as a stop on the Silver Meteor's long journey from New York to Miami, with the train passing through in the very early morning hours.</li>
            </ul>
            <h2>Miami Arrival Station</h2>
            <p>All trains from Charlotte arrive at Miami Amtrak Station, which is located in the Hialeah area northwest of downtown Miami. This location makes it important to plan onward transportation to reach the city's main attractions and beaches.</p>
